==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|k|u}}

===Etymology===
{{suffix|kuolla|ma|lang=fi}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# [[death]], [[demise]], [[decease]]
#: [[tuomita]] + ''genitive-accusative'' + ''kuolemaan'' = to [[sentence]]/[[condemn]] ''to death''.
# [[deathly]] {{gloss|in attributive use: appearing as though dead, or on the verge of death}}
#: ''Hän on '''kuoleman'''kalpea.''
#:: He has a '''deathly''' pallor.

====Declension====
{{fi-decl-koira|kuolem}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|death; euphemistic}} [[poismeno]]
* {{sense|death; poetic}} [[kuolo]]
* {{sense|death; archaic}} [[tuoni]]

====Derived terms====
* [[tehdä]] ''kuolemaa'' = to [[be]] [[die|dying]]
* [[olla]] ''[[kuolemaisillaan]]'' = to [[be]] [[at death's door]]/[[dying]]/near [[death]]
* [[olla]] ''kuoleman'' [[kieli|kielissä]] = to [[be]] [[at death's door]]
* adjectives: [[kuolematon]]

